.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH murk-diff 1  "diff " 
.SH NAME
murk\-diff \- Show secret and access changes vs a git ref (experimental)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmurk diff\fR [\fB\-\-show\-values\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-vault\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIGIT_REF\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show secret and access changes vs a git ref (experimental)
.PP
Lists recipients, signer, signing keys, policy, grants and group members that changed, then the secrets. The vault at the ref is verified first; a revision this machine\*(Aqs trust pin refuses is never shown.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-values\fR
Show actual values (not just key names)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output JSON: {"secrets": [...], "changes": [...]} (values only with \-\-show\-values)
.TP
\fB\-\-vault\fR \fI<VAULT>\fR [default: .murk]
Vault filename
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fIGIT_REF\fR] [default: HEAD]
Git ref to compare against
